<body bgcolor=white lang=EN-US style='tab-interval:.5in;word-wrap:break-word'>

<div class=WordSection1>

<div style='margin-bottom:.25in'>

<h1 style='margin-top:0in;background:#F0F5FF;border:none;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 0in 0in'><span
style='font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Studds
QC Bluetooth Device Inspection Application<o:p></o:p></span></h1>

<h3 style='margin-top:4.0pt;background:#F0F5FF'><span style='font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#1E40AF'>Technical
Specification Document (TS) â€” Detailed Line-by-Line Guide<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p style='margin-bottom:0in;background:#F0F5FF'><strong><span style='font-size:
11.0pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#24292E'>Document ID:</span></strong><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#24292E'>
STUDDS-QC-TS-DETAILED-V1.0 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong><span style='font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif'>Date:</span></strong>
2026-08-26 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong><span style='font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif'>Target
Platform:</span></strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style='margin-bottom:0in;background:#F0F5FF'><strong><span style='font-size:
11.0pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#24292E'>Author:</span></strong><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#24292E'>
Studds Software Engineering &amp; QA Architecture Team &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong><span
style='font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif'>Status:</span></strong> Approved
&amp; Production Baseline<o:p></o:p></span></p>

</div>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #E5E7EB 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #E5E7EB .75pt;padding:0in 0in 3.0pt 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>1. System Architecture in Simple Terms<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#24292E'>Think
of the application like a restaurant with 3 main parts:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

