  mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#24292E'>What the inspector
  sees on screen (buttons, progress bars, volume meters, pass/fail badges).
  Runs in a smooth native desktop window.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:2'>
  <td valign=top style='border:solid #D1D5DB 1.0pt;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:
  solid #D1D5DB .75pt;mso-border-alt:solid #D1D5DB .75pt;padding:6.0pt 8.0pt 6.0pt 8.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:
  16.0pt;margin-left:0in'><strong><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
  "Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#24292E'>2.
  The Backend Engine</span></strong><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
  "Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#24292E'><br>
  <em><span style='font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif'>(The Kitchen &amp; Chef)</span></em><o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
  <td valign=top style='border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #D1D5DB 1.0pt;
  border-right:solid #D1D5DB 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid #D1D5DB .75pt;
