  style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";color:#24292E'><br>
  (FastAPI on Port 8765)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
  <td valign=top style='border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #D1D5DB 1.0pt;
  border-right:solid #D1D5DB 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid #D1D5DB .75pt;
  mso-border-left-alt:solid #D1D5DB .75pt;mso-border-alt:solid #D1D5DB .75pt;
  padding:6.0pt 8.0pt 6.0pt 8.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:
  16.0pt;margin-left:0in'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#24292E'>Takes commands from
  the screen, controls the computer's Bluetooth radio, plays speaker sound
  files, listens to the microphone, and checks physical buttons.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
